Subject: Preserve original HBM AX live callbacks and checked physical address words

Upstream-base: f75ccf1ad20e5bd7585962990db08067c0ae498a

Keep the original AxVoice/AxManager bodies, source lists, voice decisions and
sample arithmetic. Use canonical native AXVoiceContext for live callbacks,
retain actual SDK physical conversion, and decode the original numeric AUX
context at the native carrier width. Console branches remain unchanged.
Shared 0524 compiler headers and 0530 native HBM math are separate dependencies.

